<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Q Data boosts half yr pre-excepts income.</title>
<headline>Q Data boosts half yr pre-excepts income.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended December 31</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, excluding excepts(cts)   10.1  vs    7.4</p>
<p>	- including excepts (cts)   9.6   vs   10.1</p>
<p>    Div (cts)			   2.5   vs    1.8</p>
<p>    Pre-excepts income	     23.54  vs   13.93</p>
<p>    Post-excepts income	    22.32  vs   19.09</p>
<p>    Pre-tax			    38.54  vs   23.60</p>
<p>    Tax				  14.78  vs    9.26</p>
<p>    Turnover			  481.34  vs  276.73</p>
<p>Div payable February 28</p>
<p>on register February 21</p>
<p>Full name: Q Data Ltd (electronics &amp; electrical)</p>
<p>    Exceptional items		 1.22  vs    5.16</p>
<p>NOTE - The group said it was satisfied that the acquisitions and contractual agreements entered into during the last six months both in Southern Africa and overseas had laid new foundations for continued and sustained growth.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
